Project Overview:
This is my mini project for the Programming for Problem Solving Using Python course.
It is a simple library management system that can manage books using Python OOP.

Features :
1. Add new books to the library
2. Issue a book
3. Reserve a book
4. Return a book
5. Check status of a book
6. Display all books in the catalog
7. Search a book by title or ISBN
8. Saves all books in a text file so data is not lost
9. Works using a menu in Command Line

Usage:
1. Open terminal in the project folder
2. Run the below command:
   {  python cli/main.py  }
3. The menu will appear
4. Choose any option by entering the number
